     A**
     A** WCMC - A/R TYPE CODE TABLE FILE
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PAC01                     TEXT('A/R TYPE CODE TABLE FILE')
     A            ACCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            ACKEY     R               REFFLD(KEY)
     A                                      COLHDG('KEY FIELD' '2A')
     A            ACDESC    R               REFFLD(DS30)
     A                                      COLHDG('A/R TYPE COD' 'DESCRIPTION')
     A            ACTYPE    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('P,I,A,V,S,N')
     A**                                            P = Payment
     A**                                            I = Invoice
     A**                                            A = Adjustment
     A**                                            V = Void
     A**                                            S = Stop Payment
     A**                                            N = NSF
     A            ACSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            ACUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINTENANCE' 'USER')
     A            ACPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINTENANCE' 'PGM')
     A            ACTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINTENANCE' 'TIME')
     A            ACDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINTENANCE' 'DATE')
     A            ACIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'USER')
     A            ACIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'DATE')
